NDUCTED BY AN INDEPENDENT LAB, DRAWING FROM THE TWO PIVOTAL ADUHELM PHASE 3 EMERGE AND ENGAGE TRIALS. THE FINDINGS WERE PRESENTED TODAY AT THE CLINICAL TRIALS ON ALZHEIMER'S DISEASE CONFERENCE (CTAD), HELD NOVEMBER 9-12 VIRTUALLY AND IN BOSTON, MASSACHUSETTS."}{'symbol': 'BIIB', 'date': '2021-11-11 11:20:00', 'title': "EISAI PRESENTS NEW ANALYSIS OF LECANEMAB CLINICAL EFFICACY RESULTS FROM PHASE 2B STUDY AT CLINICAL TRIALS ON ALZHEIMER'S DISEASE (CTAD) CONFERENCE", 'text': 'TOKYO AND CAMBRIDGE, MASS., NOV. 11, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EISAI CO., LTD. (HEADQUARTERS: TOKYO, CEO: HARUO NAITO, "EISAI") AND BIOGEN INC. (NASDAQ: BIIB, CORPORATE HEADQUARTERS: CAMBRIDGE, MASSACHUSETTS, CEO: MICHEL VOUNATSOS, "BIOGEN") ANNOUNCED TODAY RESULTS OF SENSITIVITY ANALYSES EVALUATING THE CONSISTENCY OF LECANEMAB EFFICACY RESULTS ACROSS MULTIPLE STATISTICAL MODELS IN PATIENTS WITH MILD COGNITIVE IMPAIRMENT (MCI) DUE TO ALZHEIMER\'S DISEASE (AD) AND MILD AD (COLLECTIVELY KNOWN AS EARLY AD). THIS PRESENTATION WAS MADE BY EISAI AT THE 2021 CLINICAL TRIALS ON ALZHEIMER\'S DISEASE (CTAD) CONFERENCE, NOVEMBER 9-12, 2021 IN BOSTON, MASSACHUSETTS AND VIRTUALLY.'}{'symbol': 'BKNG', 'date': '2021-11-12 09:00:00', 'title': 'BOOKING HOLDINGS ENTERS INTO AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE GETAROOM', 'text': 'NORWALK, CONN., NOV.\xa012, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BOOKING HOLDINGS INC. (NASDAQ:\xa0BKNG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE B2B DISTRIBUTOR OF HOTEL ROOMS, GETAROOM, FROM COURT SQUARE CAPITAL PARTNERS FOR APPROXIMATELY $1.2 BILLION.'}{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2021-11-12 06:45:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ANNOUNCES THE ACQUISITION OF\xa0HEACOCK INSURANCE GROUP', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., NOV. 12, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- J. SCOTT PENNY, CHIEF ACQUISITIONS OFFICER OF BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO), AND STACEY HEACOCK WEEKS, JASON HEACOCK AND FORD HEACOCK, III THE PRINCIPALS OF HEACOCK INSURANCE GROUP, INC. (“HEACOCK INSURANCE”), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT BROWN & BROWN HAS ACQ